    title: "Beyond Weddings: Luxury Private Celebrations and Milestone Events in Miami",
    excerpt: "Planning a milestone birthday, anniversary, shower or private celebration in Miami? Discover how thoughtful event planning and design make every occasion unforgettable.",
    category: "Private Celebrations",
    readTime: "7 min read",
    date: "November 5, 2026",
    isoDate: "2026-11-05",
    image: blogImg5,
